Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.79,0:00:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't thank you enough, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you always calling on me,\NAuntie Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon, Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:54.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we'll have no problem\Nsticking to the construction schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:00.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.58,0:01:03.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone... please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a huge... cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:54.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(588.8,590.4)}{\an7}Northwest Clays Kingdom (15 Years Ago)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:22.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It might be hot, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's perfect. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to feed the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to bring them to the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:36.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:41.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I won't go beyond the rock. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll get a wild rabbit\Nand some nuts and seeds later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll have soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec. I'll boil some more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry I'm unable\Nto do anything for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But at least live the life you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Soup's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.17,0:05:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor, it's time for bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's tonight's story?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's about an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone who once, with their friends,\Nslayed a gigantic dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:03.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and learned magic spells\Nfrom an old sorceror,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.29,0:06:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,broke a curse cast upon a forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,and obtained a cure-all elixir\Nfrom the king of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter the predicament,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,they will raise their swords and\Nstrike down evil for the sake of their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear it! I wanna hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.13,0:06:23.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, now which shall I start with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,An adventurer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But at least live the life you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't eat it all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dad, Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving town for the first time ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Goodbye for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.46,0:07:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just off the main road...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.63,0:08:24.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.38,0:08:34.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This place ain't for kids. Get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:39.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The guards at the gate said\NI could be an adventurer if I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.\NYou're gonna worry your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're dead. Both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No parents, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't do nothin' about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.71,0:08:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Noor," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Headin' to the training school\Nfor different classes, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never had a kid like you\Ndo this before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.88,0:09:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now listen good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:08.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hopefuls wantin' to register with the\Nroyal capital's Adventurer's Guild
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,go to lessons at the royal training school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Basically, you'll get training\Nfor your job class.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.29,0:09:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you wanna be an adventurer,\Ngo acquire some skills first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The art of the sword or magic,\Nstuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:28.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,A swordsman...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Heroes in the storybooks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,can fell a dragon\Nas big as a mountain in a single swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.63,0:09:56.75,Q2,,0,0,0,,A Few Months Later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.96,0:10:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait! Just give me a little longer-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Going any further is a waste of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The only thing you've retained\Nis parrying to evade an attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.96,0:10:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be better\Nif you chose another path.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.50,0:10:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your talent may be found\Nin another training school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Warrior...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,While fighting with any weapon imaginable,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.33,0:10:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,you risk your life and\Nbecome a shield for your allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:35.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's pretty close to an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.71,Q2,,0,0,0,,A Few Months Later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,but what you've acquired
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,is a slight improvement of your physical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you force yourself to continue on,\Nyou will lose your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,A hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:02.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You totally lack the sense to\Nhandle any sort of delicate weaponry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,A thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could not dismantle the trap\Non the treasure chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you can't sense anyone's presence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,so you becoming a spy\Nis out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.25,0:11:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:18.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,To think you've come this far\Nyet all you can manage is Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:23.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's rare to see people\Nas incapable of magic as you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,A cleric...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though you can heal light scratches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.04,0:11:42.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,it's impressive that you do use low-level healing\Nwithout being naturally blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.58,0:11:52.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You didn't get one decent skill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You spent a full three-month term\Npracticing at every training school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.00,0:11:57.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and you couldn't get a single one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.54,0:12:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't let you register\Nas an adventurer like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:13.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm no prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.96,0:12:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Dad, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.25,0:12:27.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I truly have no talent for anything.\NI know that for sure now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must take what I can\Nand train much, much harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,My swordsman instructor told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you practice one skill repeatedly,\Nyou may be able to master a new skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is my skill that I acquired\Nat the swordsman class training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will train!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Morning... noon... and night!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.58,0:13:05.42,Q2,,0,0,0,,1 Year Later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can evade ten swords in one breath now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have any new skills yet,\Nbut I am getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:22.04,Q2,,0,0,0,,3 Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,A hundred swords in one breath...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I still haven't acquired any new skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,At this rate, becoming an adventurer\Nis nothing but a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.67,0:14:03.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I must train more intensely!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.42,0:14:12.08,Q2,,0,0,0,,10 Years Later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,These past 14 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've trained every day without fail and\NI can now parry a thousand wooden swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.88,0:14:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And yet, no new skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, one last try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry, Physical Enhancement, Stone Throw,\NFeatherstep, Tiny Flame, Low Heal...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:56.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um... Are you sure this is what you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-well then, are you aware of the royal capital's\Nclass training school system?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.42,0:15:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here in the capital, you can take lessons\Nfrom any of our distinguished instructors and-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've already been through all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.38,0:15:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every one of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If that's the case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.42,0:15:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really can't register, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:15.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.79,0:15:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's really nothing I can do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.04,0:15:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, mind not picking\Non my new hire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.67,0:15:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been awhile, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:38.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? I have no idea who you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that... you, Noor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:49.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you kept up with your own\Nsolo training this whole time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:50.63,Q3,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:50.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you kept up with your own\Nsolo training this whole time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:55.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But in the end, I've only been able\Nto improve my parrying skill a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:15:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are different ranks of adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-rank being the highest,\Nand E-rank the lowest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,To be recognized as an E-rank,\Nyou gotta have more than one useful skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:12.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, you don't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything but give up now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.08,0:16:21.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, that doesn't mean there's\Nno other way for you to be an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's actually\Nsomething lower than E-rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:26.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The outlying F-rank, which is basically\Nunheard of even to the people involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then can I register for that one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But there are conditions to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're forbidden from taking any quests
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.00,0:16:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,that involve killing anything\Nor venturing out of the city to gather items.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:43.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What you can accept are miscellaneous tasks\Naround the city, and that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one's dumb enough to go to the trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,of becoming an adventurer\Njust to do those requests, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I'd end up with the job placement fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it used to be a job\Nfor beggars 'round the city, so-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.29,Q4,,0,0,0,,I'm okay with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it used to be a job\Nfor beggars 'round the city, so-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't mind. Register me for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's your F-rank adventurer license.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:15.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.67,0:17:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I owe you everything, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Physical Enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Featherstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.54,0:17:37.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Low Heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.08,0:17:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My dream of becoming an adventurer\Nand being of use to people has come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.54,0:18:25.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anything beyond this...\Nmay be asking for too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll see you again soon, Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:56.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, we'll have no problem\Nsticking to the construction schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.00,0:18:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.42,0:19:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone... please, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.75,0:19:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.63,0:19:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a huge... cow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.17,0:19:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've only seen these things in books,\Nbut is the actual thing really this big?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Surround it and block it's movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:41.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to protect her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do something to distract it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.96,0:19:57.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.54,0:20:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're gonna get killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stone Throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.17,0:20:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.17,0:21:05.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So much force!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,One blow from that and I'm dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:11.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need an opening to counterattack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, even if there was one...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:15.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no attack skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:21.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's still here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Featherstep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.92,0:21:43.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't become\Nthe adventurer hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:50.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to at least be able to protect\Nthe frightened girl in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No matter the predicament,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.25,0:21:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,they will raise their swords and\Nstrike down evil for the weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,and for the sake of their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That is an adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:06.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.17,0:22:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was a close one...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:30.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would have absolutely been slaughtered\Nby anything bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.13,0:22:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I thought I could travel the world\Nand go on adventures at this level...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,E-excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.75,0:22:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.29,0:22:44.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm alive because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.63,0:22:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Too bad about them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it's okay, may I have your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not anyone important.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:56.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, wai-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:00.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.58,0:23:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that one loose cow in the city\Nthat isn't even a demon was such a menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.33,0:23:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still have more training to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.67,0:23:40.63,Q5,,0,0,0,,#1: I Parry a Cow
